<description>&lt;p&gt;Grenade blasts hit the southern insurgency zone, wounding security volunteers in Narathiwar and Yala, and a pipe bomb injured army officers in the same area. Cambodia continues to protest Thai military road construction in Oddar Meanchey and disputes over three border temples, while Thai officials reject the incursion claims and urge calm over a Cambodian film about the 1979 refugee crisis. Thailand is introducing digital border passes to shorten queues at the Mae Sai crossing and has joined Singapore and Malaysia in the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPdDFuOUJfRFB3bmk3UU9kdWFBeEhXbk92WXoyUTNZRDVsU1RMdm1ZclZtQjRXSXFpbmN6VE9vNGpGZ0I4MlUwZlUyQ05ERkFZTG1uQ1JZMTY5T0FNOVY0NU5lVXJocFJabVIwcDJ0MFpIUTlGWUFLVWV2N2JLTzVzczZCaWxZbnJKSFFxcm1DSjlNeklWMFJYbVdaQk8zSUFQc0FQeHZURkJpdnZiTHVLTjROZkNHZ2Z0OG14elJoSFBfcHJrSGxDVEozUGEyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOUGQ3UkUzQWpIV0VyLUhZLTh0b1BVSFFDT1FEY3otRkRUZk1sbHNkT19wOXRIUTN3UFFZQ1dQcTctczE5YlpMV3hnMDNWRFkyVUxVUDhtcEdzMVVLRGQ0anFlUEhKLWtJTi1wWWNoNHJjQ1ZTNW85eUVBM1FFQkhxLS1GQmpQeTV5bnRsRFpGeTNCZENyeVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPZ1lnV1FkLU04eDRmdThnTU8ySXczQ0VyUmNnN2pieWtfN1A2RGFGeHR1Zi14c1M1OHFRZWxKQnBfXzNRZ0Y5RkRXbGJ6TUJDdXM3SmdtU2pEREJkNHI0U0U3NjlBU0dpLWRfSmMzOTFPRGxCelZueXdDcU5oNjVnUW4xUkMwOEdQMkZoQUxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vietnam.vn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNLXhRU2tYZGJGekVSTmxVOW54WndndzR5Uk9tMlZ4bDAwUjZYTTJDUHZtdmNjcDZ4Y2t2UFkwUm05dn